5,1,1,talk,May,,Let's get this sorted so we can stop arguing about trash! I'll check the truck arrival time from the crew leader and the supervised mornings on the next lane to see what we're dealing with.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I want to understand the actual daily impact on the residents. I'll look into the visit to the station block's bin house and the statements at the residents' meeting.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to make sure we know exactly how much this is costing us! I'll check the block ledger of refuse-point expenses and the ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Midori,,I want to make sure we find a solution that everyone can live with peacefully. I'll look into the ward complaint log for this point and the station block's meeting minutes.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is wise to gather all the facts before we decide. I shall look into the supervised mornings on the next lane and the ward filing requirements per the installations clerk.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"I think we've covered the basics, but I'm curious if anyone else wants to double-check the logistics. Otherwise, I'm good to go with my choices!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,I believe our current selection is comprehensive enough to cover both the financial and social aspects. I'm satisfied with my choices.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I'm all set too! I'm really excited to see what the numbers look like so we can find a way that works for everyone. Let's do this!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Midori,,I agree. I think we have a good variety of information coming in. I'm looking forward to seeing what we find so we can move forward together.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,I believe we have a balanced approach. Patience and preparation are the keys to a lasting harmony. I am content with my selections.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
